                                text="&lt;ol>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;span class=&quot;body-unica-16-reg&quot;>Al-Sawaf O, Robrecht S, Zhang C, et al: Venetoclax-obinutuzumab for previously untreated chronic lymphocytic leukemia. EHA2023 Hybrid Congress. Abstract S145. Presented June 8, 2023&lt;/span>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;span class=&quot;body-unica-16-reg&quot;>Chronic Lymphocytic Leukemia. Disponível em: &lt;a href=&quot;https://medlineplus.gov/chroniclymphocyticleukemia.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>https://medlineplus.gov/chroniclymphocyticleukemia.html&lt;/a>. Acesso em 18 de julho de 2024.&lt;/span>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;span class=&quot;body-unica-16-reg&quot;>What Is Chronic Lymphocytic Leukemia? Disponível em: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cancer.org/cancer/chronic-lymphocytic-leukemia/about/what-is-cll.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>https://www.cancer.org/cancer/chronic-lymphocytic-leukemia/about/what-is-cll.html&lt;/a>. Acesso em 18 de julho de 2024.&lt;/span>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;span class=&quot;body-unica-16-reg&quot;>Signs and Symptoms of Chronic Lymphocytic Leukemia. Disponível em: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cancer.org/cancer/chronic-lymphocytic-leukemia/detection-diagnosis-staging/signs-symptoms.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>https://www.cancer.org/cancer/chronic-lymphocytic-leukemia/detection-diagnosis-staging/signs-symptoms.html&lt;/a>.&amp;nbsp; Acesso em 18 de julho de 2024.&lt;/span>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ol>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;span class=&quot;body-unica-16-reg&quot;>Todos os Direitos Reservados. BR-ONC-240009. Aprovado em Julho/2024.&lt;/span>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
